{
  "_readme": [
    "THE TENSHI DESIGN GALLERY: every website design a business can launch with.",
    "This one file feeds three places: the Portfolio page (portfolio.html, built by tools/build-pages.mjs),",
    "the Launch Sequence (launch.html + launch.js, which reads it in the browser) and the Python prototype in platform/.",
    "To add a design: copy one entry, give it a new id (lowercase, dashes only) and change the words and colours.",
    "  id        - short name used in links, e.g. launch.html?template=restaurant",
    "  name      - what people see",
    "  group     - the Portfolio filter it appears under (must be one of the groups listed below)",
    "  for       - the kinds of business it suits, shown on the card",
    "  sample    - a made-up business used in the preview picture",
    "  headline  - the big line in the preview picture",
    "  colors    - primary (buttons, header), accent (highlights), surface (page background), ink (text)",
    "  style     - 'bold', 'clean' or 'elegant': changes the preview's shapes a little",
    "  pages     - the pages this design starts with",
    "  features  - what makes it special (shown in the preview)",
    "  goals     - which Launch 'Website goal' answers recommend it",
    "  categories- which Launch 'Business category' answers recommend it"
  ],
